  ("type" "SoftwareDevelopmentServiceLaw") ("version" 1) ("provider" "urn:ame:software-development-services-section")
  ("precondition" "A customer names itself and its target settlement, stable outcome, source digests, constraints, structured replayable Node acceptance commands, proposal-only delivery, finite file, byte, and time ceilings, and value agreement, then accepts the exact provider offer with an attenuated capability and attributable implementation bundle.")
